#: ../../docs/index.md:79 f08c1a11e5654b0dbd8c101c7755b85c
msgid ""
"The benchmark compares three readers on identical work: the seven Dst "
"collections of every event are decoded and nothing is written back. The "
"other branches of the `Event` tree (`TEvtHeader`, `TTrigEvent`, "
"`TEvtRecObject`, `THltEvent`) are not read."
msgstr ""
"该基准在相同的工作量下比较三个读取器：每个事件的七个 Dst 集合都会被解码，且不写回任何内容。`Event` tree "
"的其他分支（`TEvtHeader`、`TTrigEvent`、`TEvtRecObject`、`THltEvent`）不会被读取。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:81 0759b3155a254aff8b45689a0cbcef32
msgid "All readers read the same sub-branches of `TDstEvent`:"
msgstr "所有读取器都读取 `TDstEvent` 的相同子分支："

