#: ../../docs/index.md:93 873cee2ba8214ed0aa5a2cb5c41dcdd9
msgid "Pybes3 reads those sub-branches with `uproot`:"
msgstr "Pybes3 用 `uproot` 读取这些子分支："

#: ../../docs/index.md:114 3b81fd88e9fc4265a021ab0697f864ae
msgid ""
"A plain ROOT C++ program opens the same file, points a branch address at "
"the `TDstEvent` object, enables the same sub-branches and loops over "
"`TTree::GetEntry`. This is the fastest reading available without an "
"experiment framework."
msgstr ""
"一个纯 ROOT 的 C++ 程序打开同一个文件，把分支地址指向 `TDstEvent` 对象，启用相同的子分支，然后循环调用 "
"`TTree::GetEntry`。这是不借助实验组框架时最快的读取方式。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:116 143ff2843d504ed4ac13b6c0759082d1
msgid ""
"A BOSS job loops over all events and reads the same collections through "
"the transient data store, so each collection is first converted from its "
"ROOT representation into data-store objects by the Gaudi converters."
msgstr ""
"一个 BOSS 作业遍历所有事件，并通过 transient data store 读取相同的集合，因此每个集合都会先由 Gaudi "
"converter 从 ROOT 表示转换成 data store 对象。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:118 10e63375ad0d4537bb33db57d2e58010
msgid ""
"Each point is measured with `hyperfine`, using two warm-up runs and five "
"measured runs, for `1000`, `5000`, `10000`, `50000` and `100000` events."
msgstr ""
"每个数据点都用 `hyperfine` 测量，先做两次预热运行，再做五次正式测量，事件数依次为 "
"`1000`、`5000`、`10000`、`50000` 和 `100000`。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:120 c0c5a46039594ecf8bf101988b35b138
msgid ""
