" is "
"`/bes3fs/offline/data/712-1/psipp/round17/dst/231029/run_0078615_All_file001_SFO-1.dst`."
msgstr ""
"基准测试机器为 `AMD EPYC 9654`（96 核），输入文件为 "
"`/bes3fs/offline/data/712-1/psipp/round17/dst/231029/run_0078615_All_file001_SFO-1.dst`。"

