#: ../../docs/index.md:137 01edf74470374d5b9a2accafae0a2379
msgid ""
"BOSS pays 55.2 µs per event, more than twice what the other readers pay, "
"because the Gaudi converters rebuild every collection in the transient "
"data store. The file is read once in all cases; the extra time is the "
"conversion, not the I/O."
msgstr ""
"BOSS 每事件要付出 55.2 µs，超过另外两个读取器的两倍，因为 Gaudi converter 要在 transient data "
"store 中重建每个集合。三种情况下文件都只读取一次，多出来的时间是转换，而不是 I/O。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:139 72ab037137a54367a01aa44529a49872
msgid ""
"Pybes3 is almost on top of plain ROOT at 24.3 µs per event against 23.6 "
"µs. The few percent in between is the cost of building the awkward arrays"
" on top of the decoded data, while the decoding itself costs no more than"
" the generic ROOT object streamer, since the C++ kernels are generated "
"for the BES3 event layout."
msgstr ""
"Pybes3 的每事件耗时为 24.3 µs，与纯 ROOT 的 23.6 µs 几乎持平。两者之间的几个百分点来自在解码后的数据上构建 "
"awkward 数组的开销；由于 C++ kernel 是针对 BES3 事件布局生成的，解码本身并不比通用的 ROOT object "
"streamer 更贵。"

#: ../../docs/index.md:141 c3c3b9509a77495a90a75600f9ff7bab
msgid ""
"Start-up goes the other way: Pybes3 spends 566 ms before the first event "
"against 429 ms for plain ROOT, mostly importing the module and loading "
"its kernels, and 658 ms for BOSS, which also configures the event loop "
"and the persistency services. Start-up is paid once per job, so the per-"
"event column decides long jobs and this column decides short ones; either"
" way Pybes3 is twice as cheap per event as BOSS and within a few percent "
"of plain ROOT."
msgstr ""
"启动开销则相反：Pybes3 在第一个事件之前要花 566 ms，纯 ROOT 为 429 ms，BOSS 为 658 ms。Pybes3 "
"的这部分主要是导入模块和加载 kernel，BOSS "
"还需要配置事件循环与持久化服务。启动开销每个作业只付一次，因此长作业由每事件耗时一列决定，短作业由这一列决定；无论哪种情况，Pybes3 "
"的每事件开销都只有 BOSS 的一半，且与纯 ROOT 相差几个百分点。"

